724
00:41:24,160 --> 00:41:28,060
The internal mathematical space was naturally trying to be a Kreen space.

725
00:41:28,200 --> 00:41:28,820
Oh, wow.

726
00:41:28,920 --> 00:41:29,180
Right.

727
00:41:29,480 --> 00:41:34,080
