786
00:44:38,960 --> 00:44:40,800
In an asymptotically free theory,

787
00:44:41,200 --> 00:44:43,860
you start with a force that has no inherent mass scale.

788
00:44:44,460 --> 00:44:47,320
The coupling constant is dimensionless at the Planck energy.

789
00:44:47,320 --> 00:44:50,320
But as the universe cools and energy drops,

790
00:44:50,760 --> 00:44:54,440
the quantum interactions cause that coupling strength to change to run.

791
00:44:55,060 --> 00:44:56,640
Eventually, at a much lower energy,

792
00:44:56,920 --> 00:44:58,680
the interaction becomes strongly coupled

793
00:44:58,680 --> 00:45:02,320
and essentially freezes out, generating a physical mass scale.

794
00:45:02,440 --> 00:45:05,980
This is exactly how the mass of the proton is generated in QCD.

795
00:45:06,440 --> 00:45:08,180
The mass comes from the binding energy.

796
00:45:08,920 --> 00:45:11,380
Quadratic gravity does the exact same thing.

797
00:45:11,920 --> 00:45:15,220
A weakly coupled interaction at the incredibly high Planck scale

798
00:45:15,220 --> 00:45:18,680
